        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocket Golf®️ - Tap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap your golf ball across beautiful minimalist courses, bouncing over hills, flying through the sky, and traveling down each course. Whether you're a casual tapper or a perfectionist shot counter, there's a satisfying challenge here for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ <strong>Simple controls, complex physics</strong> – Just three button… and a hundred ways to screw it up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳 <strong>Side-scrolling courses</strong> – 2.5D landscapes full of verticality, wind, and momentum-based action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌪 <strong>Environmental variety</strong> – Grass, sand, water, and wind zones make every level feel alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Score tracker</strong> – Strokes per hole, total strokes, and a constant reminder of your mistakes.</p></li></ul>",
